  "body": "# What's Changed\r\n\r\nWe reverted to ClassGraph 4.8 series due to easy of maintenaince, especially wrt GraalVM native image setups. Sorry for the hassle.\r\n\r\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n- 44c09dd Revert \"fix: Initialize `io.github.classgraph.vfs.VfsFileSystemProvider` in native image at built time.\"\r\n- c167453 fix: Initialize `io.github.classgraph.vfs.VfsFileSystemProvider` in native image at built time.\r\n\r\n## 🧹 Housekeeping\r\n- 9d8f2e6 Bump org.neo4j:neo4j-cypher-dsl-bom from 2025.3.2 to 2025.3.6\r\n- f37c323 Bump jacoco-maven-plugin.version from 0.8.15 to 0.8.16 (#2086)\r\n- 8809a95 Bump io.takari.maven:maven-timeline from 2.1.0 to 2.2.0 (#2087)\r\n- a55f5ec Bump org.codehaus.mojo:exec-maven-plugin from 3.6.4 to 3.7.0 (#2088)\r\n- 4119265 Bump com.puppycrawl.tools:checkstyle from 14.1.0 to 14.4.0 (#2090)\r\n- 13193d0 Upgrade to latest Neo4j for testing.\r\n- 6c3cf33 Upgrade to ClassGraph 4.8.199.\r\n- 72f2e33 Revert \"Upgrade to Classgraph 5.\""
}
